Business Leaders Association
Pre-Professional Category
Academic Year 2025 Purpose The Business Leaders Association at UC San Diego is dedicated to providing students with the resources and opportunities to explore and grow within all aspects of business. Our organization empowers students by offering valuable insights into fields such as entrepreneurship, innovation, marketing, consulting, finance, and beyond. We strive to create a collaborative environment where students can network with like-minded peers, learn from industry professionals, and develop the skills necessary to achieve their career aspirations. By fostering a diverse community of future business leaders, the Business Leaders Association equips its members with the tools, experiences, and connections needed to succeed in their professional journeys and drive positive change in the world of business. Created 9/24/2025 Status 
