Figure Skating @ UC San Diego
Social Category
Academic Year 2025 Purpose Figure Skating at UCSD is open to anyone who loves the ice - whether you''ve been competing your whole life or you''ve never put on a pair of skates before, this team has a place for you! Our team features two components: a competitive team and a social team. Competing, while fun, is not a requirement. In addition to skating activities, our club hosts many off ice socials, such as potlucks, craft nights, and our big-little program. And with many of our members being long time skaters and some even being professional coaches, it''s a great opportunity for people who have never skated before but would love to give it a try! Created 8/22/2025 Status 
