Academic Year 2025 Purpose Global Medical Brigades (GMB) is a secular, international network of University clubs that travel to developing countries to perform health care in communities without access to medicine otherwise. GMB delivers a holistic model for sustainable health through rigorous needs assessments, sponsoring referrals to those with needs beyond our capacity, keeping accurate electronic patient records, and working to improve the water and overall public health infrastructures of the villages we serve. Created 10/20/2025 Status 
Current 
