EleFilm
Media Category
Academic Year 2025 Purpose The main goal of this filmmaking organization is to provide an inclusive platform for individuals to participate in the art of filmmaking. Our focus is on collaboration and learning through production of short films, without any barriers to entry. We welcome anyone with a passion for film and ideas to join us for filming and group learning. Through sharing our deep passion for film, we can express our thoughts and create more immersive opportunities. In addition, we will organize and participate in film festivals that can convey influential ideas and promote social change. Ultimately, our aspiration is for every member of the organization to discover their own personal definition of film. Created 10/4/2025 Status 
