Helix AI
Pre-Professional Category
Academic Year 2025 Purpose The purpose of Helix AI is to function as a high-intensity, founder-led pre-incubator at UC San Diego. Our primary mission is to bridge the critical gap between technical AI innovation and viable market strategy. We are structured to unite and empower two essential student profiles: "Builders" (AI-related students, engineers, researchers) and "Strategists" (Rady business students, marketers, and designers). Our organization achieves this purpose through three integrated pillars. First, the Helix Venture Studio is our core incubation arm. It provides project teams with tangible resources—including GPU compute, strategic advising from experienced AI founders, and a structured framework—aimed at developing ventures competitive for top-tier incubators like YC, Hsix, and The Basement. Second, Helix Media Labs is our content and education division. It produces high-quality public content on AI entrepreneurship, product analysis, and advanced knowledge management, serving to educate our members while acting as a practical training ground for marketing and content talent. Third, the Helix Atlas Project is our long-term, organization-led technical initiative to build a comprehensive, multi-lingual database of existing AI products. This provides a real-world engineering challenge and generates critical market intelligence for our venture teams. Collectively, these pillars create a robust ecosystem designed to manufacture launch-ready AI ventures and valuable entrepreneurship experiences for club members. Created 10/25/2025 Status 
Current 
