Lion Dance at UC San Diego
Dance Category
Academic Year 2025 Purpose Lion Dance at UC San Diego is established for the purpose of providing cultural enrichment to UCSD and the San Diego area by practicing, performing, and teaching the ancient art of Chinese Lion Dancing. On campus, no other traditional Chinese performing arts group exists that practices the Lion Dance. Lion Dance at UC San Diego is a unique group at UCSD. Lion Dance at UC San Diego intends to perform for any UCSD affiliated groups and events as well as non-UCSD affiliated organizations interested in our presentation. Lion Dance at UC San Diego understands and is committed to fulfilling its responsibilities of abiding by the University''s policies. Created 8/29/2025 Status 
Current 
