Educational Category
Academic Year 2025 Purpose The purpose of this student organization is to support the mission of Love and Time, a nonprofit dedicated to empowering mothers and children through mental health resources and community support. Our student organization will raise awareness on campus about maternal and child mental health through informational events on Library Walk, guest speakers, workshops, and group activities. By engaging UCSD students in service, education, and outreach, we aim to foster compassion, advocacy, and meaningful opportunities for students to make a difference in the lives of vulnerable families. Created 9/7/2025 Status 
