M.E.M.O. at UC San Diego
Service & Changemaking Category
Academic Year 2025 Purpose M.E.M.O provides medical and educational services locally in San Diego, Orange County, and Los Angeles, as well as abroad in Vietnam. We send volunteers annually to Vietnam to provide scholarships and school supplies to students in rural communities, set up free health clinics, donate monetary aid and supplies to orphanages, and sponsor heart surgeries for children with congenital heart disease. Locally in San Diego, Orange County, and Los Angeles we send volunteers to help other local non-profit organizations, set up community health fairs, and organize awareness nights on campus. Created 9/14/2025 Status 
