MDS Graduate and Professional Society
Academic Department Affiliated Category
Academic Year 2025 Purpose This organization shall advocate for all professionals and students enrolled in the Master of Data Science program. Given this program’s online curriculum, the organization will focus on supporting students abroad by creating opportunities to connect online, regional meet ups, community events, and professional support. The Master of Data Science program is a part-time graduate program, thus this organization will support working professionals as well as full-time students with resources and events that are aligned with their personal or career goals. Part of this hybrid initiative will involve maintaining a strong relationship with alumni to further foster a network that supports current students beyond graduation. Created 10/16/2025 Status 
