New Worms Poetry Club
Media Category
Academic Year 2025 Purpose We, NEW WORMS, aim to provide a space and a community for the fomentation of artistic performance in its widest possible signification. Concretely, this will take the form of a recurring time and a physical place for artistic performance (again, in the broadest sense). We, NEW WORMS, will not take a distinctive stance on the form or content of these performances. Thus, we also commit ourselves to providing a rare type of collective space on campus; i) free from categorial restriction on art; ii) emphasizing live performances to an audience of (mostly) compatriot performers, poets, and souls; iii) and determined by the collective that attends, and tends, to it. If you are feeling disconnected, possibly detached, from your artistic soul; seek us out. If you are feeling the pangs of a spiritual hunger; seek us out. If you have something to show, something that needs to be seen; seek us out. We hope that this is enough to bewilder most of you, shake something loose in some of you, and reawaken those slumbering mysteries few. Here you’ll find a safe space for yourself and, by extension, your art. While we believe in performance as a primary force to poetry (and art as a whole), attendees are by no means obligated to perform at any meeting. That being said, come! perform! Created 9/16/2025 Status 
Current 
