Poker Club
Educational Category
Academic Year 2025 Purpose Poker Club at UC San Diego is the hub for the poker community at UC San Diego to meet, learn, and play. We engage undergraduate and graduate students alike with varying poker backgrounds, from new players to those with professional tournament experience. We meet to play tournaments, hold workshops, and hear guest speakers. We are also committed to building relationships with trading and tech companies that rely on the quantitative and analytical skills poker demands for their business. Created 9/21/2025 Status 
