Reformed University Fellowship International
Spiritual Category
Academic Year 2025 Purpose The purpose of Reformed University Fellowship International at UC San Diego is to glorify God by believing, living, and proclaiming the good news of Jesus Christ in word and deed among the international community at UC San Diego. We seek to accomplish this in three key ways: (1) welcome and show hospitality to students and scholars from all nations; (2) explore the gospel of Jesus Christ with interested students and scholars; and (3) equip those students and scholars who want to honor and enjoy God in every area of life. Created 10/17/2025 Status 
