Rooted in Wellness
Educational Category
Academic Year 2025 Purpose The goal of Rooted in Wellness is to empower students with the knowledge about healthy living through the pillars of sleep, exercise, food, social connection, mental health, and spiritual health. Through educational seminars, infographics, and events, we aim to raise awareness about the health impacts of the aforementioned pillars. We seek to create a meaningful community through volunteer opportunities where members can contribute to community efforts to educate and take meaningful action to improve the pillars of health. Members will benefit from engaging in social events, networking seminars, and a chance to earn volunteer hours while actively improving their lives through one of the pillars. Rooted in Wellness aims to bring together students from all walks of life who are looking for a community that can give students the tools to improve their lives through a holistic approach. Created 8/24/2025 Status 
