Educational Category
Academic Year 2025 Purpose The goal of Transfers in Science (TiS) is to provide transfer students with academic, professional, and social support through different workshops, social activities, and volunteering. Transfer students face a different set of challenges so TiS is here to promote their achievements by providing the necessary resources for maximizing their success as well as offering a community of support, encouragement, and guidance. In addition, the goal is to help STEM transfers find their way through obtaining research and internship experiences, letters of recommendation, finding mentors, boosting resumes, grad/med school prep, and so much more! Created 9/28/2025 Status 
