Triton Divers Club
Social Category
Academic Year 2025 Purpose Triton Divers Club aims to build a welcoming and active community for scuba divers, freedivers, and snorkelers at UC San Diego. Our mission is to connect students who share a passion for the ocean, provide opportunities to meet dive partners, and create a platform for organizing group dives and ocean-related adventures. With the potential for bulk certification classes. We host social events such as bonfires and group lobster dives, as well as educational opportunities including citizen science workshops, safety checks, and gear maintenance sessions. By fostering both community and ocean stewardship, we strive to make diving more accessible, safe, and enriching for all members. Created 10/23/2025 Status 
