Academic Year 2025 Purpose Founded in 2018, our club strives to educate Rady School students about the venture capital and finance industries. We believe in using our analytical skill-sets, combined with quality communication, to bring together teams and innovative ideas for the benefit of the San Diego Community. Building upon the entrepreneurial spirit of the Rady School, our club offers members insight into how new companies are created, pitched, evaluated, and funded. Created 8/27/2025 Status 
Current 
