WAV Rec
Spiritual Category
Academic Year 2025 Purpose We are WAV Rec—a group of students who wants to build connection and memories during our time in college. We host a variety of social events and fun workshops, like cooking classes, food trips around SD, board game and snack nights, and (ofc) sports like volleyball and basketball! Beyond a purely social org, we also like to engage in deeper conversation as we spend time together—exploring themes like the meaning and purpose of life, significance and worth, each others'' passion and interests, and what God has to do in any of this. Though we share views from a Christian perspective (and invite you to ask questions and explore!), we warmly welcome anyone from any background. Created 10/15/2025 Status 
Current 
