Women''s Club Basketball @ UC San Diego
Social Category
Academic Year 2025 Purpose Our club’s purpose is to bring together a group of students who are passionate about playing basketball together and in a competitive and structured environment. We aim to create an empowering and supportive space where students of all skill levels can confidently play, grow, and thrive in basketball, fostering community, learning, and a love for the game in a safe and welcoming environment. The club is focused on women-identifying students but is open to all who are interested. The club will be composed of players that have tried out and were selected to play on our competitive team by the coaching staff and officers. Along with this roster of players, we welcome anyone who did not make the official roster to the club also, as well as anyone else who is interested in playing basketball to join us at our practices as our goal is to provide a safe and welcoming environment to students interested in expanding their game. Created 9/3/2025 Status 
