Y.E.S - Youth Empowerment in Science
Service & Changemaking Category
Academic Year 2025 Purpose Youth Empowerment in Science is a volunteer organization dedicated to inspiring a passion for science in underrepresented areas of San Diego by developing and implementing hands-on workshops in elementary schools. We understand that not all communities have the same access to STEM education opportunities. That''s why we''re committed to reaching those underserved areas, sparking curiosity, and breaking down barriers to learning. Our workshops are designed to engage and inspire students, connecting science to their everyday lives and interests. With Y.E.S., you''re not just teaching science, you''re empowering the next generation of scientists, engineers, and innovators from all backgrounds. Join us in creating a future where every child has the opportunity to say ''YES'' to the amazing world of science. To find out more or apply to be a general member check out our instagram @yesatucsd. Created 9/8/2025 Status 
Current 
