Yalla, Lets Talk! at UC San Diego
Cultural Category
Academic Year 2025 Purpose The purpose and goal of this organization is to provide a space for MENA (Middle Eastern and North African) students and those who are interested in learning various dialects in the Arabic language. The organization will be promoting the unity that languages should bring instead of the isolation of communities and culture. Organization members will be able to practice and strengthen their use of the Arabic language. They will also be joining a much larger supportive community in learning the various dialects in the language and be exposed to MENA cultures through food and drink tasting, music, dancing, etc. Created 9/12/2025 Status 
